# WH-1000XM5 Equalizer Presets on real hardware: Linux, 2026-10-12. Captured
# by the frame log in the app. The protocol info matches real-attach's, recorded
# on firmware 2.5.1. Attach reads the Equalizer available, on Off and flat. Then
# the app picks Bright, Excited, Bright, Relaxed, Bass Boost, Manual, Speech,
# Treble Boost, Relaxed, Off, Bright and Excited, each as a Preset alone. The
# Device ACKs each and then notifies the Preset with its curve, so fixed
# Presets report their curve.
